WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:02,600
Let me tell you about the situation of Lumanfeng.

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,620
First of all, there are two managers in charge of Lu Mangfeng

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,140
One is my master

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,180
There was also a man named Wang who urged me to die.

5
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:12,020
The two managers have always been at odds with each other.

6
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,500
It’s not just that the master is not willing to surrender

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,980
The servant disciples were also divided into two groups based on the two stewards.

8
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,620
There is a bit of friction if the grid is three to five.

9
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,780
In addition, the two are competing for the position of elder.

10
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:20,940
The contradiction is even greater

11
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,140
After all, my master brought you into the sect.

12
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,860
Sometimes even if you don’t want to cause trouble

13
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,700
It's inevitable that trouble will come to you, I understand.

14
00:00:28,930 --> 00:00:30,530
I'll take my little brother to do an identity rehearsal

15
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:33,570
By the way, I would like to ask if there are still any vacancies in Yaoyuan positions?

16
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:36,210
Sister Ji, you're in luck

17
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:39,050
Yao Yuan does have an empty space, so that’s just right.

18
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:42,240
Help me arrange it for Junior Brother Chu. Wait a minute.
